      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "UK Inheritance Tax (IHT) generally applies to the worldwide assets of individuals, so your offshore accounts will usually be included in the taxable estate if you are UK-domiciled. Regarding trusts, the rules are complex; depending on how the trust is set up and who benefits, it could be treated as a trust IHT or fall under estate IHT rules. It is highly recommended to consult a specialist tax advisor familiar with both UK and international estate planning to accurately assess your specific situation.",
